  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Radiance and Sea Ice Parameters",
  "description": "The data base contains Nimbus 7 SMMR radiances and sea ice parameters gridded onto the SSM/I polar stereographic projections on alternate days from October 1978 to August 1987. Radiances are from 8 of the 10 SMMR channels at both horizontal and vertical polarizations: 6.6, 10.7, 18.0, and 37.0 ghz. Sea ice parameters include total and multiyear sea ice concentrations.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Create a data base which contains Nimbus 7 SMMR radiances and sea ice parameters gridded onto the SSM/I polar stereographic projections on alternate days from October 1978 to August 1987.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23519359",
